+    error: `./dist/project-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl` is not a valid build source. Expected to receive a source directory, or a source distribution ending in one of: `.zip`, `.tar.gz`, `.tar.bz2`, `.tar.xz`, or `.tar.zst`.
+    "###);
+
+    Ok(())
+}
